  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Now that we have the OSC tracking update (amazing update by the way!), It would be cool if we could get support for hands/fingers too. Along with having the same handtracking control scheme available on Quest on the PC client too.\n\nThis would allow for using leap motion in VRChat, something many people have asked for. Or any other hand tracking solutions such as webcams, kinect, LucidVR gloves/alternatives and more.\n\nI am also going to insert this here:\n\nPlease give us more parameters and the option for IKsync parameters! Or at least the option to have them locally smoothed by the client. I really want full face tracking without sacrifice. Let us push the limits of VRChat, it will only lead to more success for the platform once advanced users can really push the limits of the game, and show it off. Thank you!",
